              </div>
              <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.65rem] font-extrabold leading-[1.15] tracking-tight text-gray-900 mb-5">DeFi Lending in 2025: How It <span class="text-purple-600">Actually Works</span> (And Where The Money Is)</h1>
              <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-6">We're tired of reading "DeFi will tokenize everything" takes from people who've clearly never used a lending protocol. So we wrote the explainer we wished existed when we started learning this stuff.</p>
            </div>
